<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Invitation to Join</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 10px; padding: 30px; margin-top: 20px;">
    <h2 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 20px;">Invitation to Join</h2>
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>You have been invited to join <strong>{{serviceName}}</strong>. Please click the button below to complete your account setup:</p>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" style="background: #3498db; color: #fff; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 16px; display: inline-block;">Accept Invitation</a>
    </div>
    <p>Or copy the following link into your browser:</p>
    <p style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; padding: 10px; word-break: break-all; font-size: 14px; color: #3498db;">{{inviteUrl}}</p>
    <p style="color: #e74c3c; font-size: 14px;">This invitation link will expire in {{expiresIn}}, please use it as soon as possible.</p>
    <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 30px;">If you were not expecting this invitation, please ignore this email.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
